  "caption": "Hours from being blown sky-high. Which landmark should tell its story next? 👇\n\nIn November 1605, Guy Fawkes was found in the cellar under the House of Lords, next to 36 barrels of gunpowder. The plan was to kill King James I as he opened Parliament. To this day, the Yeomen of the Guard search the palace cellars before every State Opening.\n\nEvery landmark has a story like this. Urban Tales plays them as you walk past. Link in bio.\n.\n.\n.\n#London #Westminster #GuyFawkes #BonfireNight #history"
